(3388203, 471016, 47852, '<td valign="top">This shot really needs the title for me to understand how it depicts ''love''.  Seems a bit dark on the left, perhaps a bit of reflected light bounced back would have helped to lighten it up since this was basic editing.</td>', 'This shot really needs the title for me to understand how it depicts ''love''.  Seems a bit dark on the left, perhaps a bit of reflected light bounced back would have helped to lighten it up since this was basic editing.', '2007-02-21 05:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388208, 472395, 47852, '<td valign="top">Matching silly outfits, and a clown across the street... and is that a stroller wheel going down the middle of the street?  This one definately makes me wonder what was going on when this was taken.</td>', 'Matching silly outfits, and a clown across the street... and is that a stroller wheel going down the middle of the street?  This one definately makes me wonder what was going on when this was taken.', '2007-02-21 05:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388211, 472477, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting.  Wish the photo was a bit bigger to see more of the detail in the flower.</td>', 'Nice backlighting.  Wish the photo was a bit bigger to see more of the detail in the flower.', '2007-02-21 05:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388212, 471746, 47852, '<td valign="top">The water drop almost looks like a teardrop here... nice softness in the background.</td>', 'The water drop almost looks like a teardrop here... nice softness in the background.', '2007-02-21 05:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388215, 472659, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute title... I''m sure someone will comment that they don''t like how you cut off the edges of the box, but I think the tighter crop works here.  I wish the lighting was a bit less harsh though.</td>', 'Cute title... I''m sure someone will comment that they don''t like how you cut off the edges of the box, but I think the tighter crop works here.  I wish the lighting was a bit less harsh though.', '2007-02-21 05:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388217, 470606, 47852, '<td valign="top">Looks like a happy moment caught here.  Not much thought seems to have been given to the lighting, background, angle etc. though, so it looks more like a quick snapshot.</td>', 'Looks like a happy moment caught here.  Not much thought seems to have been given to the lighting, background, angle etc. though, so it looks more like a quick snapshot.', '2007-02-21 05:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388219, 472370, 47852, '<td valign="top">That must make for an interesting eclipse!  Is that a bowling ball and a potato?</td>', 'That must make for an interesting eclipse!  Is that a bowling ball and a potato?', '2007-02-21 05:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388222, 471829, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a tender moment, but the photo doesn''t come close to taking advantage of the size available.  I''m not sure about the harsh center lighting either.</td>', 'Nice capture of a tender moment, but the photo doesn''t come close to taking advantage of the size available.  I''m not sure about the harsh center lighting either.', '2007-02-21 05:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388225, 472426, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute setup.. these guys look well loved.  I like the deep blue color for the background too.  Too bad this wasn''t advanced editing that you could have lightened up the smaller bears eye a bit that got caught in the shadows.</td>', 'Cute setup.. these guys look well loved.  I like the deep blue color for the background too.  Too bad this wasn''t advanced editing that you could have lightened up the smaller bears eye a bit that got caught in the shadows.', '2007-02-21 05:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388228, 471863, 47852, '<td valign="top">Interesting textures on the heart.  Lighting seems a bit harsh on the heart itself, but I suppose that''s necessary for the shadow.</td>', 'Interesting textures on the heart.  Lighting seems a bit harsh on the heart itself, but I suppose that''s necessary for the shadow.', '2007-02-21 05:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388232, 472333, 47852, '<td valign="top">The expression on his face seems to be saying "are you done taking my picture... can I move now?"... not necessarily conveying love without the help of the title.  Cute pooch though!</td>', 'The expression on his face seems to be saying "are you done taking my picture... can I move now?"... not necessarily conveying love without the help of the title.  Cute pooch though!', '2007-02-21 05:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388236, 472204, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great expression... definately a great kind of love here! :)</td>', 'Great expression... definately a great kind of love here! :)', '2007-02-21 05:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388240, 470067, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great texture in the petals.  I like the way the light hits the edges of the petals, but it seems like it either needs to be more distinct and hit more of the petals, or else not there at all and more diffused since some of the middle petals are getting lost in the shadow.</td>', 'Great texture in the petals.  I like the way the light hits the edges of the petals, but it seems like it either needs to be more distinct and hit more of the petals, or else not there at all and more diffused since some of the middle petals are getting lost in the shadow.', '2007-02-21 05:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388241, 472207, 47852, '<td valign="top">Unique shot... I like the abstract feel of it (even though I have no clue what I''m looking at).  I''m not quite sure how it conveys love without the title though.</td>', 'Unique shot... I like the abstract feel of it (even though I have no clue what I''m looking at).  I''m not quite sure how it conveys love without the title though.', '2007-02-21 05:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388242, 470718, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal composition and the two lines heading into the heart almost look like a cupid''s arrow going through it.  I wish we could see the sidewalks here under all the snow that is piled up!</td>', 'I like the diagonal composition and the two lines heading into the heart almost look like a cupid''s arrow going through it.  I wish we could see the sidewalks here under all the snow that is piled up!', '2007-02-21 05:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388244, 472192, 47852, '<td valign="top">At first glance, it''s hard to feel the love in this shot... but knowing firefighters I know how much they are dedicated to their job, so it was easy to figure this one out without the title.  A nice shot and I like the line of the ladder leading up.</td>', 'At first glance, it''s hard to feel the love in this shot... but knowing firefighters I know how much they are dedicated to their job, so it was easy to figure this one out without the title.  A nice shot and I like the line of the ladder leading up.', '2007-02-21 05:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388246, 472569, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and lighting here.</td>', 'Nice tones and lighting here.', '2007-02-21 05:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388248, 471421, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the way the lighting hits the background here to bring out the statue, and is also softly hitting the front, but seems a bit harsh on the right side.</td>', 'I like the way the lighting hits the background here to bring out the statue, and is also softly hitting the front, but seems a bit harsh on the right side.', '2007-02-21 05:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388251, 468808, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that you love the camera?  Interesting background and I like the way you angled the camera in the shot.</td>', 'I''m guessing that you love the camera?  Interesting background and I like the way you angled the camera in the shot.', '2007-02-21 05:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388254, 472189, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like that you left a rug/blanket in the shot to help the viewer to know what he''s creating.  I think this is one of those shots where the title is needed to help you figure out the challenge connection.</td>', 'I like that you left a rug/blanket in the shot to help the viewer to know what he''s creating.  I think this is one of those shots where the title is needed to help you figure out the challenge connection.', '2007-02-21 05:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388260, 472469, 47852, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the love is here... feels more like a neglected piece of a car than something well loved.  Unless you''re referring to the small spot of lighter rust which the nuts are sort of pointing to?  Still pondering.</td>', 'Not sure where the love is here... feels more like a neglected piece of a car than something well loved.  Unless you''re referring to the small spot of lighter rust which the nuts are sort of pointing to?  Still pondering.', '2007-02-21 05:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3388264, 472403, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, and I like the different color plates to help offset the shot.  The lighting is a bit harsh with the large reflections on the plate and at the top on the... tablecloth?</td>', 'Nice setup, and I like the different color plates to help offset the shot.  The lighting is a bit harsh with the large reflections on the plate and at the top on the... tablecloth?', '2007-02-21 05:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
