(3389393, 472219, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the ring shadow creating the heart in the palms, and I like the focused lighting.  Overall the shot is a bit soft/blurry though.  If this wasn''t taken with a tripod and timer/remote due to the low lighting, that would be my suggestion.</td>', 'Nice idea with the ring shadow creating the heart in the palms, and I like the focused lighting.  Overall the shot is a bit soft/blurry though.  If this wasn''t taken with a tripod and timer/remote due to the low lighting, that would be my suggestion.', '2007-02-21 11:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
