(3390538, 472446, 70000, '<td valign="top">I like this but it would be neat if the baby is in focus. Because the saturation is a little low, when you add an out of focus baby it looks almost like the baby is dead. Maybe I am just creepy but it seems like such a one way, mother loving the daughter but not hte other way around kind of thing</td>', 'I like this but it would be neat if the baby is in focus. Because the saturation is a little low, when you add an out of focus baby it looks almost like the baby is dead. Maybe I am just creepy but it seems like such a one way, mother loving the daughter but not hte other way around kind of thing', '2007-02-21 15:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
