(3390550, 472715, 57060, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot, lots of emotion (which is good in a "love" challenge!) Technically there are some things that might have helped the image - just my opinion of course. First, it seems kinda noisey - obviously in low light and needing a faster shutter you cranked up the iso, but neat image or something similar may have helped. Second the crop is not the best, the bright light in the upper L corner distract as do the plants and the wall on the R. Finally, the colors don''t do too much and B&amp;W may have helped. That said, I still think this is a great shot, and you got the most important thing right.<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Great candid shot, lots of emotion (which is good in a "love" challenge!) Technically there are some things that might have helped the image - just my opinion of course. First, it seems kinda noisey - obviously in low light and needing a faster shutter you cranked up the iso, but neat image or something similar may have helped. Second the crop is not the best, the bright light in the upper L corner distract as do the plants and the wall on the R. Finally, the colors don''t do too much and B&W may have helped. That said, I still think this is a great shot, and you got the most important thing right. 7 Jack', '2007-02-21 15:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390551, 472455, 70000, '<td valign="top">I think the softening here is a bit much. I like the softness but there are some places where its so heavy that it makes destracting blotches. Nice composition though.</td>', 'I think the softening here is a bit much. I like the softness but there are some places where its so heavy that it makes destracting blotches. Nice composition though.', '2007-02-21 15:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390554, 471810, 70000, '<td valign="top">WOW I really like this. How did you do this was he holding her? How did he get her back up? I would like to see a bit more contrast or just a tad darker because there are places on the girls face and dress that are just a tad blown, but I still LOVE what you ahve done here.</td>', 'WOW I really like this. How did you do this was he holding her? How did he get her back up? I would like to see a bit more contrast or just a tad darker because there are places on the girls face and dress that are just a tad blown, but I still LOVE what you ahve done here.', '2007-02-21 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390562, 472437, 57060, '<td valign="top">Well crafted paper hearts, very neat and clean. Not too much emotion but a good shot.<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Well crafted paper hearts, very neat and clean. Not too much emotion but a good shot. Jack', '2007-02-21 16:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390573, 470187, 57060, '<td valign="top">Very clever, nice touch. 8<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Very clever, nice touch. 8 Jack', '2007-02-21 16:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390594, 470432, 51517, '<td valign="top">Very clever...</td>', 'Very clever...', '2007-02-21 16:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390753, 471810, 37845, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I''m guessing that she is actually laying down, and that this is a birds eye view. Either way you shot it, it was very well executed.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I''m guessing that she is actually laying down, and that this is a birds eye view. Either way you shot it, it was very well executed.', '2007-02-21 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390761, 472507, 37845, '<td valign="top">Hahahah.. thats funny :)</td>', 'Hahahah.. thats funny :)', '2007-02-21 17:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
