(3390825, 471962, 37845, '<td valign="top">Lose the cigarette, and I agree with you 100% :)</td>', 'Lose the cigarette, and I agree with you 100% :)', '2007-02-21 17:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390855, 472072, 67694, '<td valign="top">nice take on John 3:16. i did one for the "Good" challenge. good luck</td>', 'nice take on John 3:16. i did one for the "Good" challenge. good luck', '2007-02-21 17:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390873, 472507, 67694, '<td valign="top">Absolutely hysterical 8^)))</td>', 'Absolutely hysterical 8^)))', '2007-02-21 17:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3390953, 468955, 37845, '<td valign="top">Wow... what an incredible photo. This has my vote for best shot. 10 all the way.</td>', 'Wow... what an incredible photo. This has my vote for best shot. 10 all the way.', '2007-02-21 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391029, 471608, 34938, '<td valign="top">OK, here in this instance you have really stretched the challenge. While you LOVE watching this, without knowing this, it''s just a picture of a vehicle to me. Nothing in the title even suggests that this is something you love. So it is more of a free study to me that you are trying to fit into a challenge. When I thought of the love challenge, I thought it would be an image that would evoke love...in another challenge like ''favourite sports'' or ''cars'' or ''off the ground'' or ''jum'' or whatever, this would have done well...but when you see a car between roses and hearts and hands and babies, it just seems out of place...hope that helps</td>', 'OK, here in this instance you have really stretched the challenge. While you LOVE watching this, without knowing this, it''s just a picture of a vehicle to me. Nothing in the title even suggests that this is something you love. So it is more of a free study to me that you are trying to fit into a challenge. When I thought of the love challenge, I thought it would be an image that would evoke love...in another challenge like ''favourite sports'' or ''cars'' or ''off the ground'' or ''jum'' or whatever, this would have done well...but when you see a car between roses and hearts and hands and babies, it just seems out of place...hope that helps', '2007-02-21 18:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391045, 470307, 65234, '<td valign="top">Mom looks quite proud and happy.  The softness is a nice effect for this kind of shot, but there is a halo/shadow sort of thing going on all along the edge of the subjects that is a little odd to me.  I also think the composition would be a little cleaner if the baby''s arm were not on top of the mother''s on the right; I had to look closely before I was sure what the lump there was and it takes away a little from the powerful image of a mother''s encircling arms.</td>', 'Mom looks quite proud and happy.  The softness is a nice effect for this kind of shot, but there is a halo/shadow sort of thing going on all along the edge of the subjects that is a little odd to me.  I also think the composition would be a little cleaner if the baby''s arm were not on top of the mother''s on the right; I had to look closely before I was sure what the lump there was and it takes away a little from the powerful image of a mother''s encircling arms.', '2007-02-21 18:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391051, 471810, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s just scary!  Lot of trust demonstrated here.  And nice composition.</td>', 'That''s just scary!  Lot of trust demonstrated here.  And nice composition.', '2007-02-21 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391053, 468959, 74495, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and execution, but not the four coloured sections.</td>', 'I like the idea, and execution, but not the four coloured sections.', '2007-02-21 18:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391055, 472562, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail; you can practically feel the velvet softness of the petals.</td>', 'Very nice detail; you can practically feel the velvet softness of the petals.', '2007-02-21 18:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391062, 472385, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awww; I have a picture like that of my daughter''s hand.  A little twist to get the ring centered on the visible part of the finger and light bouncing right off the gems would make this stronger IMO, but I like the idea.</td>', 'Awww; I have a picture like that of my daughter''s hand.  A little twist to get the ring centered on the visible part of the finger and light bouncing right off the gems would make this stronger IMO, but I like the idea.', '2007-02-21 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391067, 472403, 34938, '<td valign="top">i WOULD have liked to have seen the whole plate...the white stuff at the top is distracting...nice, but needs some work</td>', 'i WOULD have liked to have seen the whole plate...the white stuff at the top is distracting...nice, but needs some work', '2007-02-21 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391074, 472437, 34938, '<td valign="top">lovely colours and image overall...that paper spec in the middle of the heart says ''look at me'' but nithing you could do I guess...overall nice image 7</td>', 'lovely colours and image overall...that paper spec in the middle of the heart says ''look at me'' but nithing you could do I guess...overall nice image 7', '2007-02-21 18:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391077, 472064, 65234, '<td valign="top">I don''t happen to get all emotional about cars (which may explain why I''m happy driving a minivan), but I know other people do, and this is the kind they fall in love with.  Would have liked it a wee bit better if you could have stood a little to the right so the stuff on the right in the back could be cropped out, but don''t know if that was possible.</td>', 'I don''t happen to get all emotional about cars (which may explain why I''m happy driving a minivan), but I know other people do, and this is the kind they fall in love with.  Would have liked it a wee bit better if you could have stood a little to the right so the stuff on the right in the back could be cropped out, but don''t know if that was possible.', '2007-02-21 18:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391083, 469411, 65234, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice and it does sort of look like they are kissing.  Or rubbing noses.</td>', 'Colors are nice and it does sort of look like they are kissing.  Or rubbing noses.', '2007-02-21 18:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391088, 472143, 34938, '<td valign="top">the best in the challenge...good luck 10</td>', 'the best in the challenge...good luck 10', '2007-02-21 18:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
