(3391101, 471640, 65234, '<td valign="top">So ... the pumpkin is missing another pumpkin somewhere outside the window?  Mayve left behind on the vine when this one was picked?  Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'So ... the pumpkin is missing another pumpkin somewhere outside the window?  Mayve left behind on the vine when this one was picked?  Interesting take on the challenge.', '2007-02-21 18:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391112, 471265, 65234, '<td valign="top">There is lovely intimacy in this shot.  Looks a little grainy to me and cool (white balance-wise) for a sunset shot.</td>', 'There is lovely intimacy in this shot.  Looks a little grainy to me and cool (white balance-wise) for a sunset shot.', '2007-02-21 18:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391114, 468959, 34938, '<td valign="top">this will be dqed I am sure...as far as an image is concerned it is wonderful, but your filters over the top aren''t legal. I will score you as if it was legal in any case</td>', 'this will be dqed I am sure...as far as an image is concerned it is wonderful, but your filters over the top aren''t legal. I will score you as if it was legal in any case', '2007-02-21 18:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391127, 471976, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s not entirely clear to me what the subject of the shot is supposed to be.  The lamp is obviously the brightest thing and large and in the foreground, but the bears are on a heart so I keep thinking they were supposed to be the focal point.  Unless there is a relationship between the bears and the lamp ... dunno''.  This one is befuddling me.</td>', 'It''s not entirely clear to me what the subject of the shot is supposed to be.  The lamp is obviously the brightest thing and large and in the foreground, but the bears are on a heart so I keep thinking they were supposed to be the focal point.  Unless there is a relationship between the bears and the lamp ... dunno''.  This one is befuddling me.', '2007-02-21 18:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391131, 472602, 65234, '<td valign="top">You don''t look all that happy for having something you love in hand.</td>', 'You don''t look all that happy for having something you love in hand.', '2007-02-21 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391141, 471885, 65234, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit of a stretch for this challenge, or I''m just not imaginative enough to get it.  I don''t think the "buildings" add much to the composition, and I would like the picture better with a totally solid background instead of the wall being a lighter color.</td>', 'Seems a bit of a stretch for this challenge, or I''m just not imaginative enough to get it.  I don''t think the "buildings" add much to the composition, and I would like the picture better with a totally solid background instead of the wall being a lighter color.', '2007-02-21 18:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3391144, 471423, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting expression on Mom''s face.  Daughter looks like she''s suppressing a giggle.  Pose is sweet.</td>', 'Interesting expression on Mom''s face.  Daughter looks like she''s suppressing a giggle.  Pose is sweet.', '2007-02-21 18:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
