(3391700, 471630, 31403, '<td valign="top">you love this photo because you understand the perspective - the situation around it.  From the "outside" this is hard to comprehend - I''m not sure what I''m seeing - thought it was a roller coaster first, now maybe a mall?  Your main subject compositionally is covering his face, most of the image is out of focus - these issues make it hard to give it a good score.  Sorry I don''t like your photo, but i hope that helps you understand why.</td>', 'you love this photo because you understand the perspective - the situation around it.  From the "outside" this is hard to comprehend - I''m not sure what I''m seeing - thought it was a roller coaster first, now maybe a mall?  Your main subject compositionally is covering his face, most of the image is out of focus - these issues make it hard to give it a good score.  Sorry I don''t like your photo, but i hope that helps you understand why.', '2007-02-21 21:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
