(3391717, 468730, 31403, '<td valign="top">if this were a visual scavenger hunt you would win.<br/> <br/>But the flat lighting here makes this really look like a quick snapshot - hard to give a good score to.<br/> <br/>It''s a good idea, I would try leaving the room dark, opening a window (day) or one lamp on at night and setting up on a table or tripod and capturing the outline of his features from the dark side of room - shooting toward the light.  You may need some fill light to even out the exposure a little, a bounce card of poster board maybe?<br/> <br/>Then the lighting is more creative, it looks like you tried to take a nice shot, and voters will be nicer and give you better scores.  Hope that helps.</td>', 'if this were a visual scavenger hunt you would win. But the flat lighting here makes this really look like a quick snapshot - hard to give a good score to. It''s a good idea, I would try leaving the room dark, opening a window (day) or one lamp on at night and setting up on a table or tripod and capturing the outline of his features from the dark side of room - shooting toward the light.  You may need some fill light to even out the exposure a little, a bounce card of poster board maybe? Then the lighting is more creative, it looks like you tried to take a nice shot, and voters will be nicer and give you better scores.  Hope that helps.', '2007-02-21 21:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
