(3392805, 472670, 60614, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge by far.  This is not a typical shot if you know what I mean.  It is different from everything else that is in the challenge.  It is neat how you have all the birds flying up in the sky.  Lighting seems good.  It would have been nicer if the sky had a bit more color but then it could be my monitor.  The graffiti is sending out the message of love for all to see.  Oh yeah, nice composition, especially the way the grass is pointing to the words "More Love".  Great job.</td>', 'This meets the challenge by far.  This is not a typical shot if you know what I mean.  It is different from everything else that is in the challenge.  It is neat how you have all the birds flying up in the sky.  Lighting seems good.  It would have been nicer if the sky had a bit more color but then it could be my monitor.  The graffiti is sending out the message of love for all to see.  Oh yeah, nice composition, especially the way the grass is pointing to the words "More Love".  Great job.', '2007-02-22 06:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392909, 472568, 62164, '<td valign="top">there is a bit more noise for my likeing and a little but light may have helped</td>', 'there is a bit more noise for my likeing and a little but light may have helped', '2007-02-22 08:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392910, 469411, 62164, '<td valign="top">the colors jump at you! nice</td>', 'the colors jump at you! nice', '2007-02-22 08:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3392925, 470307, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus.   Bit of a halo around the subjects.  Wonderful selection in subjects.</td>', 'Nice soft focus.   Bit of a halo around the subjects.  Wonderful selection in subjects.', '2007-02-22 08:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
