(3393040, 472477, 58728, '<td valign="top">The pic is a little too small.  But I love the lighting on the flower. The composition is good as well.  Just wish it was bigger so I could see it better.</td>', 'The pic is a little too small.  But I love the lighting on the flower. The composition is good as well.  Just wish it was bigger so I could see it better.', '2007-02-22 09:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393042, 471423, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones... I would be interested in hearing what duotone color values you used.  Nice arrangement as well.  AK?  hum... that is my Daugther''s initals.</td>', 'Very nice tones... I would be interested in hearing what duotone color values you used.  Nice arrangement as well.  AK?  hum... that is my Daugther''s initals.', '2007-02-22 09:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
