(3393044, 472453, 58728, '<td valign="top">Lovely scenery...and how sweet is the proposal!?  The only distracting part of the image for me is their legs getting cut off.</td>', 'Lovely scenery...and how sweet is the proposal!?  The only distracting part of the image for me is their legs getting cut off.', '2007-02-22 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393045, 470917, 72929, '<td valign="top">Clever concept, like the tonality of the photo, but it being out of focus is distracting.</td>', 'Clever concept, like the tonality of the photo, but it being out of focus is distracting.', '2007-02-22 09:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393051, 469220, 58728, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...cute idea...although it looks mostly out of focus to me.  I wish the ring was sharper so we could see the beautiful details of it.</td>', 'Hmmm...cute idea...although it looks mostly out of focus to me.  I wish the ring was sharper so we could see the beautiful details of it.', '2007-02-22 09:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393052, 472681, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones.  I think the lighting was a bit harsh, but you handled it well.   Lovely eyes.   Very nice focus.  It would be fun to apply some of the more advanced editing rules to the image.</td>', 'Very nice tones.  I think the lighting was a bit harsh, but you handled it well.   Lovely eyes.   Very nice focus.  It would be fun to apply some of the more advanced editing rules to the image.', '2007-02-22 09:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393056, 470961, 72929, '<td valign="top">Nice studio lighting, but it is lacking emotion. The models look like they''re posing, or at the very least, disinterested in one another.</td>', 'Nice studio lighting, but it is lacking emotion. The models look like they''re posing, or at the very least, disinterested in one another.', '2007-02-22 09:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393057, 472616, 45343, '<td valign="top">Nice selection of off center composition.</td>', 'Nice selection of off center composition.', '2007-02-22 09:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393058, 470681, 58728, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The only thing distracting to me is the out of focus foreground. I Love a shallow dof, but I feel like maybe if you had cropped a little different and had eliminated a bit of the blur, it may have worked a little better for me.</td>', 'I really like this.  The only thing distracting to me is the out of focus foreground. I Love a shallow dof, but I feel like maybe if you had cropped a little different and had eliminated a bit of the blur, it may have worked a little better for me.', '2007-02-22 09:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393059, 471057, 72929, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, and reflections off the water. Good use of a photo that birding photographers would toss away. Classic symbol of lifelong commitment.</td>', 'Nice colors, and reflections off the water. Good use of a photo that birding photographers would toss away. Classic symbol of lifelong commitment.', '2007-02-22 09:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393061, 471969, 58728, '<td valign="top">Very touching.  I wish it was a little bit bigger though.</td>', 'Very touching.  I wish it was a little bit bigger though.', '2007-02-22 09:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3393062, 472293, 72929, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been way better without that crease in the plastic tarp there. It creates a visual distracting element right in the center of the photo, drawing my eyes away from the subjects.</td>', 'Would''ve been way better without that crease in the plastic tarp there. It creates a visual distracting element right in the center of the photo, drawing my eyes away from the subjects.', '2007-02-22 09:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
