(3393067, 472555, 72929, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept, would have been better in a candid setting instead of in a studio.</td>', 'This is a great concept, would have been better in a candid setting instead of in a studio.', '2007-02-22 09:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
