(3393290, 472000, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute shot at first glance, but after looking at it a bit longer, it seems very staged and not as spontaneous as the title would let you hope for.  The facial expressions are awkward... the boy looks like he''s sniffing her cheek and not necessarily giving her a kiss, and I can''t decide what the girl''s expression is saying.  A nice setup though with the clean background and the soft lighting.</td>', 'Cute shot at first glance, but after looking at it a bit longer, it seems very staged and not as spontaneous as the title would let you hope for.  The facial expressions are awkward... the boy looks like he''s sniffing her cheek and not necessarily giving her a kiss, and I can''t decide what the girl''s expression is saying.  A nice setup though with the clean background and the soft lighting.', '2007-02-22 10:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
