(3393984, 470187, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nicely composed shot. I really like it.<br/>Few nitpicks though, the sky is overly noisy compared to the rest of the photo. And the footsteps, two pairs of people but one pair of footsteps? ;) well in concept you could say, it''s as if they''re indeed together , as a whole. I know how things can come together and not be at the photographer''s control. Even if the shot where staged, either way. I didn''t take points off my voting scale if I thought it was or not. It''s the final shot that counts.</td>', 'It''s a very nicely composed shot. I really like it.Few nitpicks though, the sky is overly noisy compared to the rest of the photo. And the footsteps, two pairs of people but one pair of footsteps? ;) well in concept you could say, it''s as if they''re indeed together , as a whole. I know how things can come together and not be at the photographer''s control. Even if the shot where staged, either way. I didn''t take points off my voting scale if I thought it was or not. It''s the final shot that counts.', '2007-02-22 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
