(3397037, 471810, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice allusion to the famous magazine cover in the 40''s or 50''s.  <b>"Sailor boy comes home &amp; gives his one true love a hearty kiss with a dip to boot."</b>  :)  But the real question is...<i>"Am I looking at a man on an upper level holding his love off the side?"...or...as I suspect "Am I looking at a woman lying down on an upper tier with her love standing up &amp; leaning over?"</i> (Top-Down view.)</td>', 'Nice allusion to the famous magazine cover in the 40''s or 50''s.  "Sailor boy comes home & gives his one true love a hearty kiss with a dip to boot."  :)  But the real question is..."Am I looking at a man on an upper level holding his love off the side?"...or...as I suspect "Am I looking at a woman lying down on an upper tier with her love standing up & leaning over?" (Top-Down view.)', '2007-02-23 08:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
