(3397243, 471608, 47852, '<td valign="top">Feels like this vehicle was placed into the environment and not really there... something about the lighting maybe, or the fact that there is no sand/dirt anywhere on the car, and it feels like there should be.  Just feels out of place.</td>', 'Feels like this vehicle was placed into the environment and not really there... something about the lighting maybe, or the fact that there is no sand/dirt anywhere on the car, and it feels like there should be.  Just feels out of place.', '2007-02-23 09:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3397256, 472309, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Feels a bit too smooth (processing?) and then sharpened with the jagged white edge around the head and some of the water.  If this weren''t basic editing, I''d like to have seen the eyes brightened up/brought out a bit more.</td>', 'Cute shot.  Feels a bit too smooth (processing?) and then sharpened with the jagged white edge around the head and some of the water.  If this weren''t basic editing, I''d like to have seen the eyes brightened up/brought out a bit more.', '2007-02-23 09:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
