(3400337, 472343, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of love and a well timed shot with the sun just about to set.  I''m not crazy about the border color (it doesn''t seem to match anything in the shot), and I wish you''d straightened the horizon.  Too bad this was basic editing, or you could have cloned out whatever is sticking up out on the horizon and done a few more adjustments to separate areas of the water and sky to help make them more dramatic.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Nice depiction of love and a well timed shot with the sun just about to set.  I''m not crazy about the border color (it doesn''t seem to match anything in the shot), and I wish you''d straightened the horizon.  Too bad this was basic editing, or you could have cloned out whatever is sticking up out on the horizon and done a few more adjustments to separate areas of the water and sky to help make them more dramatic.  Nicely done!', '2007-02-24 07:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3400341, 472232, 47852, '<td valign="top">Unique border choice.  I''m not sure that it works any better or worse than the normal line most people use, but it''s nice to see something different.  As for the photo, I wish you could see just a little bit more of the one lying down, but you''ve used the color nicely to help bring her out a bit more.</td>', 'Unique border choice.  I''m not sure that it works any better or worse than the normal line most people use, but it''s nice to see something different.  As for the photo, I wish you could see just a little bit more of the one lying down, but you''ve used the color nicely to help bring her out a bit more.', '2007-02-24 08:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3400342, 470211, 47852, '<td valign="top">This shot definately needs the title to make a connection to the challenge.  I don''t find it to be a very interesting photo, and I find it odd that my eye doesn''t wander around more considering that you''ve placed a subject on the line of thirds and you have all the lines of the steps in there.</td>', 'This shot definately needs the title to make a connection to the challenge.  I don''t find it to be a very interesting photo, and I find it odd that my eye doesn''t wander around more considering that you''ve placed a subject on the line of thirds and you have all the lines of the steps in there.', '2007-02-24 08:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
