(3402969, 472534, 47852, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, and a sweet letter.  While the words may be authentic to the time period, the letter itself feels too new... fresh, bright white unfolded paper, and more modern handwriting than I would picture from so many years ago.</td>', 'Nice setup, and a sweet letter.  While the words may be authentic to the time period, the letter itself feels too new... fresh, bright white unfolded paper, and more modern handwriting than I would picture from so many years ago.', '2007-02-25 10:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402971, 472468, 47852, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the kitty here.. she blends into the pattern of the sofa and is tucked too far off to the side of the photo for me.  Adorable moment though!</td>', 'I almost missed the kitty here.. she blends into the pattern of the sofa and is tucked too far off to the side of the photo for me.  Adorable moment though!', '2007-02-25 10:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402979, 472041, 47852, '<td valign="top">Ok, never would I have thought that a picture of some cows could portray love so nicely.  Yep, I could go on about some of the good technical aspects of this one, but really, it''s all about the love here (well, and a few piles of cow poo).  I think what really tops this one off for me, is the little white heart on the big cows head.  Very sweet.  Mooooo!</td>', 'Ok, never would I have thought that a picture of some cows could portray love so nicely.  Yep, I could go on about some of the good technical aspects of this one, but really, it''s all about the love here (well, and a few piles of cow poo).  I think what really tops this one off for me, is the little white heart on the big cows head.  Very sweet.  Mooooo!', '2007-02-25 10:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402980, 470980, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful close up, and I love the tight petals in the center... maybe a bit overdone with the water droplets?</td>', 'Beautiful close up, and I love the tight petals in the center... maybe a bit overdone with the water droplets?', '2007-02-25 10:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402981, 468804, 47852, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done... nice soft sepia tones, and a great use of shallow dof.  The border feels a bit incomplete since you can clearly see the lighter section near the hand (almost too much like you accidentally hit the eraser right under the finger), you can slightly see it going up the sides, but it''s hard to see any of it near the bottom.  Just a minor issue though... this is a nice image which depicts the topic well.</td>', 'Very nicely done... nice soft sepia tones, and a great use of shallow dof.  The border feels a bit incomplete since you can clearly see the lighter section near the hand (almost too much like you accidentally hit the eraser right under the finger), you can slightly see it going up the sides, but it''s hard to see any of it near the bottom.  Just a minor issue though... this is a nice image which depicts the topic well.', '2007-02-25 10:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3402982, 468955, 47852, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.. great tones, and I like how the subjects are brought out a bit by the fact that each persons jacket is against opposite colors.</td>', 'Very nicely done.. great tones, and I like how the subjects are brought out a bit by the fact that each persons jacket is against opposite colors.', '2007-02-25 10:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403114, 472715, 74537, '<td valign="top">I like this picture.  I prefer to see a photo that looks candid and not posed.  This photo has that feel and to me says love, and does not require a caption to make me see the love. I wouldn''t venture a guess as to the kind of love, as this could be a couple, siblings or friends, but they definitely love each other.  The question as to the type of love causes me to look deeper at the subjects in an effort to determine the answer.<br/> <br/>As for the composition and color, I like the overall look of the photo.  There are interesting things in the background to give dimension to the photo, without being distracting to the subject in the foreground.</td>', 'I like this picture.  I prefer to see a photo that looks candid and not posed.  This photo has that feel and to me says love, and does not require a caption to make me see the love. I wouldn''t venture a guess as to the kind of love, as this could be a couple, siblings or friends, but they definitely love each other.  The question as to the type of love causes me to look deeper at the subjects in an effort to determine the answer. As for the composition and color, I like the overall look of the photo.  There are interesting things in the background to give dimension to the photo, without being distracting to the subject in the foreground.', '2007-02-25 11:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403187, 471969, 70000, '<td valign="top">I think a little bit stronger depth of field would have helped the couple pop out, either way i really like the composition and naturalness of the shot :)</td>', 'I think a little bit stronger depth of field would have helped the couple pop out, either way i really like the composition and naturalness of the shot :)', '2007-02-25 12:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403192, 472008, 70000, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait, its a nice step up from your battle of the sexes shot yall really look natural and the coloring and lighting is also great.</td>', 'I really like this portrait, its a nice step up from your battle of the sexes shot yall really look natural and the coloring and lighting is also great.', '2007-02-25 12:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403200, 472563, 70000, '<td valign="top">I have heard the high key photos don''t really do well but whatever. I REALLY like this alot. You can see just enough features to really grasp the connection between the two. Howeverm I don''t think this needed so much processing and smoothing. You could have let it stay a bit more natural.</td>', 'I have heard the high key photos don''t really do well but whatever. I REALLY like this alot. You can see just enough features to really grasp the connection between the two. Howeverm I don''t think this needed so much processing and smoothing. You could have let it stay a bit more natural.', '2007-02-25 12:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403214, 471421, 70000, '<td valign="top">IT is hard to make pictures of statues that stay interesting then the statue is such a static object. I think you have picked a very interesting subject but I would have liked to have maybe seen the part of the statue where they are actually kissing. The back of the woman is also a bit blown.</td>', 'IT is hard to make pictures of statues that stay interesting then the statue is such a static object. I think you have picked a very interesting subject but I would have liked to have maybe seen the part of the statue where they are actually kissing. The back of the woman is also a bit blown.', '2007-02-25 12:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403217, 472534, 70000, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here and the emotions this picture evokes. It would be nice to see the paper have the age to it that the date says it has. It looks like it was written like yesterday. Still, beautiful photo.</td>', 'I really like the composition here and the emotions this picture evokes. It would be nice to see the paper have the age to it that the date says it has. It looks like it was written like yesterday. Still, beautiful photo.', '2007-02-25 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3403225, 470451, 70000, '<td valign="top">You did a good job of keeping the focus on the heart even with all the other stuff going on in the photo. Nice</td>', 'You did a good job of keeping the focus on the heart even with all the other stuff going on in the photo. Nice', '2007-02-25 12:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
