(3406227, 472339, 27170, '<td valign="top">The shot doesn''t seem very sharp to me and the frame doesn''t really add anything to the shot, it looks like you just took a pic thru it?  It was a neat idea and a challenge to photograph glass but this composition doesn''t really work.</td>', 'The shot doesn''t seem very sharp to me and the frame doesn''t really add anything to the shot, it looks like you just took a pic thru it?  It was a neat idea and a challenge to photograph glass but this composition doesn''t really work.', '2007-02-26 11:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406230, 471588, 27170, '<td valign="top">I get the idea, but this just looks like a snapshot.  Might have been better if  you could see the dog''s eyes or if it looked happy?</td>', 'I get the idea, but this just looks like a snapshot.  Might have been better if  you could see the dog''s eyes or if it looked happy?', '2007-02-26 11:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406242, 472715, 27170, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t look very springy - they''re in coats and hats, indoors with potted plants.  An outdoor shot might or some sun might have made your title fit better.</td>', 'This just doesn''t look very springy - they''re in coats and hats, indoors with potted plants.  An outdoor shot might or some sun might have made your title fit better.', '2007-02-26 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406251, 471291, 27170, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity of this shot and the choice of black and white works really well, especially with the architectural details.  Think I might have cropped a bit more off the left but no biggie.  But you captured the body language nicely and it is easy to believe they are smitten with each other.  Nice job!</td>', 'Like the simplicity of this shot and the choice of black and white works really well, especially with the architectural details.  Think I might have cropped a bit more off the left but no biggie.  But you captured the body language nicely and it is easy to believe they are smitten with each other.  Nice job!', '2007-02-26 11:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406255, 471546, 27170, '<td valign="top">Wow, how does this show love? If it''s in that paper then I need a subscription!</td>', 'Wow, how does this show love? If it''s in that paper then I need a subscription!', '2007-02-26 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406264, 471792, 27170, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh once I saw the detail..lol.  Looks like your focus was dead on as well - it really isolates the little buggers. Besides being funny, it''s perfect that the background is blurred and dull and the rope a bright yellow, so that your tiny subjects stand out more.  Good work!</td>', 'This made me laugh once I saw the detail..lol.  Looks like your focus was dead on as well - it really isolates the little buggers. Besides being funny, it''s perfect that the background is blurred and dull and the rope a bright yellow, so that your tiny subjects stand out more.  Good work!', '2007-02-26 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406266, 472461, 27170, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!</td>', 'What a cutie!', '2007-02-26 11:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406277, 472219, 27170, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea (the symbolism of the holding hands) and the low key lighting you chose (the ring shadow is cool).  The only thing is the focus on the ring.  If that were sharper with perhaps a glint of light from the stone it would be very lovely! Still, props for the great idea and effort.</td>', 'I really like this idea (the symbolism of the holding hands) and the low key lighting you chose (the ring shadow is cool).  The only thing is the focus on the ring.  If that were sharper with perhaps a glint of light from the stone it would be very lovely! Still, props for the great idea and effort.', '2007-02-26 11:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406279, 472478, 27170, '<td valign="top">umm, where is the love?</td>', 'umm, where is the love?', '2007-02-26 11:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406281, 469327, 27170, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection in the drop!</td>', 'Love the reflection in the drop!', '2007-02-26 11:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406285, 471630, 27170, '<td valign="top">Dont see how this shows love?</td>', 'Dont see how this shows love?', '2007-02-26 11:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406292, 469213, 27170, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. heavy idea - love last forever even tho people don''t. I think what might have been nice or had more impact is perhaps a shot where the angle shows the sun or something else living - to show the promise of the idea?  Or maybe your subject looking into the future.  Just a thought.  I think the pink is a bit overdone here but I do like your basic idea.</td>', 'Hmmm. heavy idea - love last forever even tho people don''t. I think what might have been nice or had more impact is perhaps a shot where the angle shows the sun or something else living - to show the promise of the idea?  Or maybe your subject looking into the future.  Just a thought.  I think the pink is a bit overdone here but I do like your basic idea.', '2007-02-26 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3406293, 470901, 27170, '<td valign="top">Don''t see love here?</td>', 'Don''t see love here?', '2007-02-26 11:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
