(3406374, 472293, 11313, '<td valign="top">i love this.The color is great for this photo.It''s like shes trapped in a dream and can''t seem to break the berrior down to get to her true love.</td>', 'i love this.The color is great for this photo.It''s like shes trapped in a dream and can''t seem to break the berrior down to get to her true love.', '2007-02-26 12:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
