(3412262, 470296, 66635, '<td valign="top">For those who don''t understand the connection between the egg and love, it''s in the title.  "Choose to L''oeuf...  "Oeuf" is a French word that means "egg."  It''s pronunciation is very similar to "love" except, mostly, for the "f" instead of the "v."  Greetmir was being funny to the select few who would be able to understand what he was doing.</td>', 'For those who don''t understand the connection between the egg and love, it''s in the title.  "Choose to L''oeuf...  "Oeuf" is a French word that means "egg."  It''s pronunciation is very similar to "love" except, mostly, for the "f" instead of the "v."  Greetmir was being funny to the select few who would be able to understand what he was doing.', '2007-02-28 04:26:30.000000', NULL, 0),
