(3413094, 472333, 11854, '<td valign="top">What a cutie pie! A dog gives the ultimate love too. No matter how they are treated, they will wag their tails and lick your hand. I''m going to ramble for a minute... I cried over a purina dog food commercial yesterday. They are showing dogs in a pound, with a dog "speaking" to you. "I can play fetch, I can rollover, I''m a good dog, but I don''t understand how I got here and I just want to go home". All of them had your doggies eyes, so sad! I hope you go give her/him a big hug.</td>', 'What a cutie pie! A dog gives the ultimate love too. No matter how they are treated, they will wag their tails and lick your hand. I''m going to ramble for a minute... I cried over a purina dog food commercial yesterday. They are showing dogs in a pound, with a dog "speaking" to you. "I can play fetch, I can rollover, I''m a good dog, but I don''t understand how I got here and I just want to go home". All of them had your doggies eyes, so sad! I hope you go give her/him a big hug.', '2007-02-28 09:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
