(3413722, 471810, 45559, '<td valign="top">Congrats! Awesome photo.</td>', 'Congrats! Awesome photo.', '2007-02-28 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3413728, 472091, 54885, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the wonderful comments even the digital Holga made me laugh out loud. I wanted to get my grandmother''s face a little clearer, but my nephew was acting like a boy so This was a one shot deal so I tried to soft focus the whole shot with picasa2. I agree-that this shot needs more focus, so to me all the comments were right on key. I do wonder if someone will ever make a digital Holga-I love some of the shots that I have viewed from that camera.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-28 12:05:29.</i></td>', 'I appreciate the wonderful comments even the digital Holga made me laugh out loud. I wanted to get my grandmother''s face a little clearer, but my nephew was acting like a boy so This was a one shot deal so I tried to soft focus the whole shot with picasa2. I agree-that this shot needs more focus, so to me all the comments were right on key. I do wonder if someone will ever make a digital Holga-I love some of the shots that I have viewed from that camera.', '2007-02-28 12:04:04.000000', '2007-02-28 12:05:29.000000', 0),
(3413903, 471810, 20530, '<td valign="top">A perfect illustration of what can be achieved when the right and left brains work together in absolute harmony.<br/> <br/>You''ve married the organic, emotional and colorful to the geometric, analytical and monochromatic in a ceremony of classic composition.<br/> <br/>I LOVE it! Another well deserved ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-28 12:52:17.</i></td>', 'A perfect illustration of what can be achieved when the right and left brains work together in absolute harmony. You''ve married the organic, emotional and colorful to the geometric, analytical and monochromatic in a ceremony of classic composition. I LOVE it! Another well deserved ribbon.', '2007-02-28 12:51:54.000000', '2007-02-28 12:52:17.000000', 0),
(3413970, 471293, 65438, '<td valign="top">Ha! I knew this was yours - La Jolla Shores.  Great shot.  Who was the dumb ass that gave it a 1? As far as those that said it didn''t meet the challenge, ''love'' comes in many forms, not just the standard hearts and hugs stuff. I totally get it, because I too love living next to the ocean.</td>', 'Ha! I knew this was yours - La Jolla Shores.  Great shot.  Who was the dumb ass that gave it a 1? As far as those that said it didn''t meet the challenge, ''love'' comes in many forms, not just the standard hearts and hugs stuff. I totally get it, because I too love living next to the ocean.', '2007-02-28 13:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
