(3425253, 471810, 48954, '<td valign="top">Like i said great shot. One thing though. A bench in the bottom of the frame could have helped "ground" the shot. it would have made it clearer that she hanging on the balcony. When I i saw it the first time I had a hard time figuring out what was going on. Nevertheless, it''s a great and original shot. It''s good to have you on the site.</td>', 'Like i said great shot. One thing though. A bench in the bottom of the frame could have helped "ground" the shot. it would have made it clearer that she hanging on the balcony. When I i saw it the first time I had a hard time figuring out what was going on. Nevertheless, it''s a great and original shot. It''s good to have you on the site.', '2007-03-03 10:33:10.000000', NULL, 0),
