(3567208, 472478, 61651, '<td valign="top">for my Team Suck initiation...a little Vogon poetry.  Could we dim the lights please?<br/> <br/>&lt;ahem&gt;<br/> <br/>Ode to a Larva Lamp<br/> <br/>O, great green globuloglobe,<br/>Your fullonimous bulbequats crush my hambiloid.<br/>What syberary decortment, what mabile flunction,<br/>To awaken all Vogonity?<br/> <br/>No - sleepless moonwarps swiftly linger.<br/>Your silken incandecritude disgorges all sanity,<br/>And couples with soft cumulominums.<br/>My daredevil!<br/></td>', 'for my Team Suck initiation...a little Vogon poetry.  Could we dim the lights please? <ahem> Ode to a Larva Lamp O, great green globuloglobe,Your fullonimous bulbequats crush my hambiloid.What syberary decortment, what mabile flunction,To awaken all Vogonity? No - sleepless moonwarps swiftly linger.Your silken incandecritude disgorges all sanity,And couples with soft cumulominums.My daredevil!', '2007-04-20 22:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
